<Stub
  title="Ropes Course in Boise, ID | Bodies in Motion"
  description="High aerial ropes course at Bodies in Motion in Boise, Idaho: Open Ropes, Cosmic Ropes adventures and ropes birthday parties."
  path="/ropes-course"
  h1="Ropes Course at Bodies in Motion"
  eyebrow="Encourage. Empower."
>
  <p>
    There are three ways to enjoy the Ropes Course at Bodies in Motion: Cosmic Ropes Adventure, Cosmic Ropes Birthday
    Party, and Open Ropes. Open Ropes is a 45 minute high aerial ropes adventure with free range swinging and hanging.
    Participants must be 10 years old with an adult, or 10 years old and 5 feet tall to go up without an adult. Open
    Ropes is $16 (+ tax) per person, and a reservation is required: call <a href={NAP.phoneTel}>{NAP.phoneDisplay}</a>
    to RSVP.
  </p>
